["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isan", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Standard Audiovisual Number (ISAN)](https://www.isan.org/about/#what_is_isan) is a unique 24-digit hexadecimal identifier for audiovisual works standardized by [ISO 15706](https://www.iso.org/standard/83124.html). The ISAN remains persistent for a work regardless of its distribution format or its use. To facilitate human readability, the \"ISAN\" label, grouping hyphens, and two check characters are included (e.g., `ISAN 0000-0000-3A8D-0000-Z-0000-0000-6`); however, these elements shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., `000000003A8D000000000000`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Ne90c7e30f33b4539b5dca20b6b926ecd", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/SupportType/development", "globalId", "", ""]
